 US illegally by their parents to live, work and contribute to...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103990563874801","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-745","post_id":"745","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103985905610001","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-23","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/745/","text":"I've spent a lot of time over the past year meeting with news organizations to talk about how we can work better together. As more people get more of their news from places like Facebook, we have a...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103985905610001","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1871","post_id":"1871","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/BYEtPYMhW6L/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-21","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1871/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-744","post_id":"744","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103974481199611&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/744/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-743","post_id":"743","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103974027783261","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/743/","text":"When Max was born, I took two months of paternity leave. I will always be grateful I could spend so much time with her in the first months of her life.\n\nOur new daughter is coming soon, and I'm...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103974027783261","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-742","post_id":"742","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103969849282011","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/742/","text":"We aren't born hating each other. We aren't born with such extreme views. We may not be able to solve every problem, but we all have a responsibility to do what we can. I believe we can do something...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103969849282011","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-741","post_id":"741","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103966803505771","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-15","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/741/","text":"We just announced that we're building our 10th (!!!) major data center in New Albany, Ohio. All our new data centers are some of the most advanced and energy efficient in the world -- powered with...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103966803505771","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-861","post_id":"861","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103953494202721","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/861/","text":"We believe it's possible to rethink a lot of experiences through the lens of building community -- including watching video. Watching a show doesn't have to be passive. It can be a chance to share an...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103953494202721","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-991","post_id":"991","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103935153048541","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-08-01","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/991/","text":"Every summer we run Facebook Academy to connect high school juniors from our local community in Menlo Park and East Palo Alto with mentors so they can get experience working in the tech industry....","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103935153048541","text_truncated":false}]